              of estimation models based on {RHT} was finally improved to 0.8 with {RMSE} decreased to 11.7 Mg/ha using exact terrain slopes from {ALS} data. This study demonstrated the great potential of slope-adaptive metrics of {GEDI} waveforms on estimations of forest aboveground biomass over mountainous areas.},
