10 citations (Crossref/{DOI}) [2026-01-07]
32 citations (Semantic Scholar/{DOI}) [2026-01-06]},
	keywords = {{GEDI}, {SAR}, Canopy height, Machine learning, Optical, Tropical mixed forests},
