135 citations (Crossref/{DOI}) [2026-01-07]
135 citations (Crossref/{DOI}) [2026-01-07]
Number: 12},
	keywords = {Sentinel-1, Sentinel-2, soil moisture, irrigation, {NDVI}, Water Cloud Model},
	file = {Full Text PDF:/Users/schwartz/Zotero/storage/UZEDYBA7/Bousbih et al. - 2018 - Soil Moisture and Irrigation Mapping in A Semi-Ari.pdf:application/pdf},
